{% extends 'layout.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}About Us - ForkLore{% endblock %}

{% block page_styles %}
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('styles/about.css') }}">
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
    <main class="about-page">
        <section class="about-hero">
            <span class="about-label">OUR STORY</span>
            <h1>More Than Just<br>Recipes.</h1>
            <p>
                ForkLore began with a simple idea: to give Mom a place where she could
                write down the recipes she knew and loved.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="about-story">
            <div class="about-story-heading">
                <span class="about-label">WHY FORKLORE EXISTS</span>
                <h2>A recipe can be<br>more than a recipe.</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="about-story-content">
                <p>
                    The original idea behind ForkLore was simple. I wanted to give Mom
                    a journal where she could keep the recipes she knew, the meals she
                    loved making, and the memories that came with them.
                </p>
                <p>
                    That idea eventually grew into something bigger: a digital recipe
                    journal where recipes can be preserved, shared, and discovered.
                    Instead of letting those recipes stay hidden in notebooks or get
                    forgotten over time, ForkLore gives them a place to live.
                </p>
                <p>
                    What started as a small idea for a personal gift became a platform
                    for celebrating the stories behind food and the people who keep
                    those traditions alive.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="about-highlight">
            <div class="about-highlight-content">
                <span class="about-label">THE IDEA</span>
                <h2>
                    Preserving recipes.<br>
                    Making room for new stories.
                </h2>
                <p>
                    ForkLore is built around the belief that food connects people.
                    Every recipe can carry a memory, a tradition, a place, or a person
                    behind it.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="about-ending">
            <span class="about-label">OUR HOPE</span>
            <h2>
                Because sometimes,<br>
                the best memories<br>
                begin with food.
            </h2>
            <p>
                ForkLore is our way of keeping those recipes around while giving new
                ones a chance to become part of the story.
            </p>
        </section>
    </main>
{% endblock %}
